Vamos prosseguir com a traducao do hino 10:

010. Christ is the Word of God
referencias biblicas do hino: John 1:1-4; 6:63; 14:6 - 2 Tim 3:16-17 - Rom 10:17

1. Read them over again to me, 
words from the Holy Bible;
Let me more of their beauty see, 
wonderful word of God,
Words of life and of beauty, 
teachings of faith and duty.

    Refrain:
    Christ is the Word, sent from above; 
    only in Him, true life is found.
    Christ is the One, God sent in love; 
    His love for us abounds.

2. Christ, the blessed One, gives His own
eternal life in glory.
Words of God in our hearts are sown, 
words of eternal life,
Blessed and freely given, 
leading us unto heaven.

3. Joyfully follow Jesus' call, 
as He leads on to heaven;
He gives pardon and peace to all,
by grace, through faith in Him.
Jesus, the only Savior, 
sanctifies us forever.

A partitura eh 6/8 em G Maior, velocidade 132 colcheias

As notas sao:
Notas para as estrofes 1, 2 e 3:
verset 1: sm c c c c sm c sm.
verset 2: c c c sm c sm. sm.
verset 3: cm c c c c sm c sm.
verset 4: c c c sm c m.
verset 5: sm c c c c sm. sm.
verset 6: sm c c c c sm. sm.

notas para o refrain:
verset 1: c c c sm. c c c sm.
verset 2: c c c sm c sm c sm.
verset 3: c c c sm. c c c sm.
verset 4: c c c sm c m.

legenda: 
sb = semibreve
m = minima
sm = seminima
c = colcheia
sc = semicolcheia
m. = minima pontuada
sm. = seminima pontuada
c. = colcheia pontuada

A primeira estrofe e o refrain da musica podem serem ouvidos em https://soundcloud.com/fccusa/010-christ-is-the-word-of-god

Traduza, seguindo todas orientacoes ja discutidas, dentre elas: 
1. Manter o sentido da letra em ingles (se possivel);
2. Manter uma coesao biblica com os trechos de referencia;
3. Ser cantavel (forneci a sequencia de notas para as estrofes e refrao, siga-as) com fluidez melódica e adequação silábica;
4. Escolher palavras apropriadas à velocidade da musica;
5. Preferir 1 silaba para cada som.
6. Qualidade e acertividade como no hino 9.
